# Pricing

This Document is the machine-wide price table. Tangent ships a seeded table
with the same rates, and this Document overrides it: a provider and model
written here replaces the seeded rate, and a model the seed does not know is
added by writing it here. Edits apply on the next reading. No restart.

Every number is United States dollars for one million tokens. Write `null` for
a whole model when the rate is unknown; a missing model is unknown too.
Neither means zero, and neither is ever guessed at.

`cacheWrite` is the five-minute cache-write rate and `cacheWrite1h` is the
one-hour rate. `input` means the tokens charged at the full input rate, with
cache excluded.

`fastMode` is optional and holds the `input` and `output` rates that apply when
Claude Code ran the request in fast mode. Only those two change; the cache
rates stay. A model that has one must keep it here, because this Document
replaces the seeded rate for that model outright rather than merging with it.

These are API list prices. Under a subscription they measure the work a
conversation did, not money that left an account.

The `openai` entry is present and empty on purpose. Codex ships no price data
at all, so codex work reports tokens and no dollars until real numbers are
written here. Write them and the top-bar figure stops excluding codex.

Install this file at `~/.tangent/trees/pricing.md`.

```tangent.pricing.v1
{
  "version": 1,
  "currency": "USD",
  "providers": {
    "anthropic": {
      "note": "Claude Code 2.1.258 baked price catalog, verified against recorded cost-state totals.",
      "models": {
        "claude-opus-5": { "input": 5, "output": 25, "cacheWrite": 6.25, "cacheWrite1h": 10, "cacheRead": 0.5, "fastMode": { "input": 10, "output": 50 } },
        "claude-opus-4-8": { "input": 5, "output": 25, "cacheWrite": 6.25, "cacheWrite1h": 10, "cacheRead": 0.5 },
        "claude-opus-4-7": { "input": 5, "output": 25, "cacheWrite": 6.25, "cacheWrite1h": 10, "cacheRead": 0.5, "fastMode": { "input": 30, "output": 150 } },
        "claude-opus-4-6": { "input": 5, "output": 25, "cacheWrite": 6.25, "cacheWrite1h": 10, "cacheRead": 0.5, "fastMode": { "input": 30, "output": 150 } },
        "claude-opus-4-5": { "input": 5, "output": 25, "cacheWrite": 6.25, "cacheWrite1h": 10, "cacheRead": 0.5 },
        "claude-opus-4-1": { "input": 15, "output": 75, "cacheWrite": 18.75, "cacheWrite1h": 30, "cacheRead": 1.5 },
        "claude-opus-4-0": { "input": 15, "output": 75, "cacheWrite": 18.75, "cacheWrite1h": 30, "cacheRead": 1.5 },
        "claude-fable-5-1": { "input": 10, "output": 50, "cacheWrite": 12.5, "cacheWrite1h": 20, "cacheRead": 0.25 },
        "claude-fable-5": { "input": 10, "output": 50, "cacheWrite": 12.5, "cacheWrite1h": 20, "cacheRead": 1 },
        "claude-sonnet-5": { "input": 2, "output": 10, "cacheWrite": 2.5, "cacheWrite1h": 4, "cacheRead": 0.2 },
        "claude-sonnet-4": { "input": 3, "output": 15, "cacheWrite": 3.75, "cacheWrite1h": 6, "cacheRead": 0.3 },
        "claude-sonnet-3": { "input": 3, "output": 15, "cacheWrite": 3.75, "cacheWrite1h": 6, "cacheRead": 0.3 },
        "claude-haiku-4-5": { "input": 1, "output": 5, "cacheWrite": 1.25, "cacheWrite1h": 2, "cacheRead": 0.1 }
      }
    },
    "resetdata-glm": {
      "note": "Julian's ResetData account rates, given 2026-09-02. The endpoint publishes no separate cache-write price, so a write bills at the input rate.",
      "models": {
        "zai/glm-5.2": { "input": 1.58, "output": 4.96, "cacheWrite": 1.58, "cacheWrite1h": 1.58, "cacheRead": 0.16 }
      }
    },
    "zai-openai": {
      "note": "No rates supplied. Write them here to price GLM-5.2 Direct.",
      "models": {}
    },
    "zai-anthropic": {
      "note": "No rates supplied. Write them here to price the Claude-shaped GLM endpoint.",
      "models": {}
    },
    "openai": {
      "note": "Codex publishes no rates and Codex CLI ships none. Write the real numbers here to make codex spend a dollar figure instead of a token count.",
      "models": {}
    },
    "litellm": {
      "note": "The gateway account codex-gw reaches. Its rates are the gateway's, not OpenAI's.",
      "models": {}
    }
  }
}
```
